## What Did NOT Work (and why)

- **`preview_screenshot` timed out (30s)** — the preview renderer hangs on screenshot (modal/renderer issue, NOT my change). Worked around it entirely with `preview_eval` DOM queries + API fetches, which proved the UI mounts and the routes work. Do not rely on preview_screenshot in this preview server.
- **First `DELETE /api/assets/{id}` returned 500 once** — transient; the immediate retry returned 200 and deleted the smoke theme cleanly. Not reproducible. (Asset was DRAFT → deletable; theme_status PATCH does NOT change the asset status enum, so delete stayed allowed.)
- **(carryover, still true)** push hook `verify-trio-on-push` — this push actually SUCCEEDED without override, so the earlier "environmental tsc-PATH failure" did not bite this time. If a future push blocks environmentally, override with a trailing `# no-verify` AFTER verifying the trio manually from `webapp/`.

