## Decisions Made

- **Bible §34 strip = direct in-place content overwrite, status stays LOCKED** — reason: Director q1a explicitly «не надо лок-анлок, я разрешил». No v02/DRAFT/review/LOCK ceremony; just shortened the DB content + left a one-line pointer to Themes.
- **Polina STAYS on Opus** (`CONCIERGE_PROVIDER=anthropic`) — reason: Director q2. Do NOT revert to gemini. (Cost fences remain: cap 40 + $20/day breaker + SPIN + S2(b) escalate-not-loop.)
- **Themes = per-theme DB assets `SPC-theme_{slug}`**, curation status in `metadata.theme_status` (approved|draft|invalidated), free any→any via PATCH — NOT the asset status enum (which renames the file). No DB migration (allowed SPC- prefix).
- **Next episode = The Vending Machine** (Director q4) — start from draft theme `the_vending_machine`.
- **proposeTheme reuses the POST route** via internal fetch (anti-additivity) rather than touching the DB directly.

